      "content": "it sounds nice when you say that but it doesn't feel real. it's like, every time I try to be \"different\" I just end up back in the same dark place. like i'm just a placeholder until the cycle repeats itself. i feel like the only way to actually stop the damage is for it to just... stop. if i'm not here, then the cycle can't pass through me anymore. it feels like the only way to protect the people i love is to just not be a part of this anymore.",
